  "id": "pulled-beef-tacos",
  "name": "Pulled Beef Tacos",
  "subtitle": "Slow-braised beef with chipotle, lime, and fresh toppings",
  "description": "Beef shin is braised with vinegar, citrus, chipotle, and warm spices until tender, then shredded and served in soft tacos with bright garnishes.",
